 "notes": [
  {
   "text": "Bitcoin plunged below $60,000 on Friday Nov 20, 2026, trading at $58,186.39 in the early evening, down about 6% on the day and 15.5% over seven days, after touching $57,799.29 \u2014 its lowest price since September 2024.",
   "source": "The Motley Fool",
   "url": "https://www.fool.com/coverage/stock-market-today/2026/11/20/crypto-market-today-nov-20-bitcoin-plunges-below-usd60-000-as-wall-street-s-sell-off-spreads-to-crypto/"
  },
  {
   "text": "The Nasdaq Composite fell 5.3% to 22,617.73 on Friday Nov 20, 2026 and Nvidia dropped nearly 14%, as Wall Street reassessed AI valuations, data-center spending and the prospect of further Federal Reserve rate increases; Friday's rout triggered about $1.9 billion of leveraged crypto liquidations in 24 hours, per Coinglass.",
   "source": "Bitcoin.com News",
   "url": "https://news.bitcoin.com/market-updates/strategy-coinbase-shares-battered-bitcoin-price-2-year-low-ai-stocks-bleed/"
  },
  {
   "text": "US spot Bitcoin ETFs recorded $582.19 million of net outflows on Thursday Nov 19, 2026, with $541.08 million of that from BlackRock's IBIT \u2014 its largest daily outflow since its January 2024 launch \u2014 bringing the Nov 17-19 total to about $1.13 billion.",
   "source": "Bloomingbit",
   "url": "https://en.bloomingbit.io/feed/news/124852"
  },
  {
   "text": "US spot Bitcoin ETF outflows reached about $3.47 billion in November 2026 through Nov 19, with net withdrawals on 12 of the month's first 14 trading sessions, about $1.04 billion short of the roughly $4.51 billion monthly record set in June 2026.",
   "source": "KuCoin News",
   "url": "https://www.kucoin.com/news/flash/us-spot-bitcoin-etfs-record-3-47-billion-in-november-outflows"
  },
  {
   "text": "October core PCE and Q3 GDP are both due Wednesday Nov 25, 2026 at 8:30 a.m. ET, with the Fed's Beige Book that afternoon; US markets are closed Thursday Nov 26 for Thanksgiving, and no FOMC meeting falls in the Nov 23-27 week.",
   "source": "Kiplinger",
   "url": "https://www.kiplinger.com/investing/economy/this-weeks-economic-calendar&gsessionid=F1gdbT0v_EqUcPCrGTvMMdVh216PDFjcibBHblo4Ec0Wx6vK9uUAQw"
